      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Let it be registered on behalf of the office of supervision,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">if God wills.&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">They have registered the amount of two, a quarter and a sixth. They have registered the amount of two, a quarter and a sixth.&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God, with the praise of those who give thanks.&nbsp;Praise be to God for his bounties.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid receipt has been granted to the warehouse-keeper in the province of al-Fayy\u016bm on behalf of \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan ibn Wahb</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the estate-manager, for the year four-hundred and three, under the supervision of the auspicious, rightly-guided judge,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u1e6eiqat al-Mulk Makin al-Dawla wa-\u02beAm\u012bnuh&atilde;, the prot&eacute;g&eacute; of the commander of&nbsp;the faithful, \u02beAb\u016b al-\u1e24asan \u02bfAl\u012b ibn Bah\u0101r,&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">with \u02beAb\u016b al-Sar\u012b Theodor ibn Yu\u1e25annis acting as accountant.&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Half of this: One, an eighth, and two q\u012br\u0101ts (= twelfth). Its amount: Two, a quarter and a sixth.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Written by M\u012b\u1e35\u0101\u02be\u012bl ibn \u02bfAbd al-Mas\u012b\u1e25, the cashier. Valid. The twenty-fourth of Mu\u1e25arram,&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">in the year four-hundred and four.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
